+| **Fluorescent lighting**        | 12       | 15      | 20       | 15      | W/m²         | [Est] Older offices: 15 W/m² (total installed).  Higher if older fixtures.      |
+| **LED lighting**               |  8       | 10      | 12       | 10      | W/m²         | [Est] Modern LED ~8–10 W/m² for office/classroom lighting.    |
